Three exclusions are NON-NEGOTIABLE whatever the table says:

| Exclusion | Rule |
|-----------|------|
| Documentation (`docs/**`) | Owned by a SEPARATE doc flow. Refs INTO docs are checked for RESOLUTION only; contents are never read-for-edit and NEVER edited |
